AngelSpec
Copyright (C) 2026 Tencent. All rights reserved.
https://github.com/Tencent/AngelSpec
DFly2's architecture and arithmetic were reimplemented for TensorFold using
the AngelSpec reference. Its full license and third-party notices are retained
in LICENSES/AngelSpec-LICENSE.txt.

Changes made by this integration:
- Added DFly2 configuration and byte-preserving TP2 weight loading.
- Added target-cache/index capture, accepted-anchor handling, a native DFly2
  forward path and CUDA primitives, and optional model/lanes dispatch.
- Added isolated build and validation tools and sanitized numerical evidence.
- Optimized the DFly2 FP4 value decoding without changing its finite values.

The original pre-optimization CUDA implementation is retained under the same
Apache-2.0 integration license in evidence/kernels/ for benchmark reproduction.

No model weights, NVIDIA container image, or deployment kernel kit are included.
ATTRIBUTION.md records the source revisions and the role of each component.
